  "description": "Acid, chrome: on a near-black vignette, the mark in polished chrome (a diagonal horizon-gradient fill clipped to the mark, a lit bevel and a white rim from raw filter primitives, no 3D), a wide chrome wordmark with a small bevel, a few glinting four-point sparkles and small mono lines. With format 'release' it re-composes for a 3000×3000 cover: the wordmark over the chrome mark, the release title in the same chrome across the foot, all three painted as a reflected horizon (sky, a hard dark horizon, warm ground) with a keyline, an inner bevel and a hard shadow, no lighting filters. Re-expressed from the Logomarks scenes lab (FlyerCards, 'Acid · chrome').",
